        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, at Mini CHP plant, allocation heat</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, at Mini CHP plant, allocation heat
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in Mini-BHKW, allocation heat' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at Mini-BHKW, allocation heat' and 'electricity, at Mini-BHKW, allocation heat'.;
UUID: 9064d448-65b2-3a05-b8bc-169ee7517f6b
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Specific manufacturer (Ecopower in Switzerland)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9064d448-65b2-3a05-b8bc-169ee7517f6b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
